  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "永續觀光與生態旅遊",
    "sub_ename": "SUSTAINABLE TOURISM AND ECOTOURISM",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在傳達學生關於永續發展與觀光產業之連結，並介紹生態旅遊概念、定義及其實質內涵，以增進大家對環境、經濟和社會文化三個面向的觀光發展建立正確的觀念，讓學生深切體認永續發展與生態保育對人類生存與安居樂業的重要性。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to convey to students the connection between sustainable development and tourism, introduce the concept, definition, and essence of ecotourism, enhance everyone's correct understanding of tourism development from three aspects: environment, economy, and social culture, and enable students to understand sustainable development deeply. The importance of sustainable development and ecological protection to human survival and living and working in peace and contentment.",
